  "title": "Slow Cooker Egg Casserole",
  "description": "Sausage, hash browns, Cheddar cheese, and seasoned scrambled eggs are cooked low and slow in a slow cooker for a breakfast casserole that the whole family with enjoy.",
  "authors": [
    "Paul Hiles"
  ],
